<title>JAPAN: NCR Japan -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>NCR Japan -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 51.95		vs	   46.47</p>
<p> Operating	    1.04		vs	    2.24</p>
<p> Current		1.50		vs	    2.19</p>
<p> Net		  762    million	  vs	    2.25</p>
<p> EPS		    3.46 yen	  vs	   10.22 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    220 million	  vs	 220 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.50 yen	  vs	    4.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - NCR Japan Ltd imports and sells large computers produced by parent company in US.</p>
